<title>USA: Exporters sell 101,600 tonnes corn to Japan - USDA.</title>
<headline>Exporters sell 101,600 tonnes corn to Japan - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. exporters reported the sale of 101,600 tonnes of U.S. corn to Japan for 1996/97 delivery, U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday.</p>
<p>Marketing year opened last Sept 1.</p>
<p>By law, exporters must promptly report any sales exceeding 100,000 tonnes of a commodity.</p>
